<title>CANADA: Canadian residential mortgage rates.</title>
<headline>Canadian residential mortgage rates.</headline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Bankers Association prevailing market rates</p>
<p>    6 MONTHS     6.5 (open) 5.25 (closed) (as of Oct 3)</p>
<p>    6 MONTHS     5.6 (flexible or convertible)</p>
<p>    1 YEAR	 6.20  (open) 5.35 (closed) (as of Oct 24)</p>
<p>    2 YEARS	5.85  (closed)</p>
<p>    3 YEARS	6.35  (closed)</p>
<p>    4 YEARS	6.75  (closed)</p>
<p>    5 YEARS	7.20  (closed)</p>
<p>    7 YEARS	7.65  (closed)</p>
<p>   10 YEARS	8.40  (closed)</p>
<p>(Rates shown are the lowest offered among big six banks.)</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
